  "summary": "Well-structured TypeScript project with correct Azure SDK usage, latest package versions, proper streaming uploads, and lease-based concurrency control. Main weaknesses are the complete absence of error handling (no RestError catches, no 404/409 handling) and the listBlobs() method collecting all results into an array despite using for-await-of, which contradicts the streaming/pagination anti-pattern guidance.",
  "issues": [
